{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Lori Van Sickle (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that before she became one of Delaware's top golfers, <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lori_Van_Sickle\" title=\"Lori Van Sickle\">Lori Van Sickle</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> had to choose between golfing and her job at a newspaper?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lori_Van_Sickle","retrieved":1785746865021},{"title":"one of the first naval engagements of World War I (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Lake_Nyasa\" title=\"Battle of Lake Nyasa\">one of the first naval engagements of World War<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>I</a></b> took place in Africa?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Lake_Nyasa","retrieved":1785746865023},{"title":"one block in New York City (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a lawsuit over <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schermerhorn_Row_Block\" title=\"Schermerhorn Row Block\">one block in New York City</a></b> cost a museum millions of dollars in legal fees?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schermerhorn_Row_Block","retrieved":1785746865023},{"title":"Aaron Titus (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaron_Titus\" title=\"Aaron Titus\">Aaron Titus</a></b> proposed to his future wife by having her solve questions whose answers spelled out \"Will you mar<sup>2</sup>y me\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aaron_Titus","retrieved":1785746865024},{"title":"Battle of Mons Lactarius (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Mons_Lactarius\" title=\"Battle of Mons Lactarius\">Battle of Mons Lactarius</a></b> marked the end of the Ostrogothic kingdom with the death of their last king, Teia?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Mons_Lactarius","retrieved":1785746865026},{"title":"Wrest Park (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the English Heritage charity stores a third of its architectural salvage at <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wrest_Park\" title=\"Wrest Park\">Wrest Park</a></b>, including items made to impress Elizabeth<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>I?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wrest_Park","retrieved":1785746865028},{"title":"Sô Y Tiết (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Vietnamese cattle herder <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sô_Y_Tiết\" title=\"Sô Y Tiết\">Sô Y Tiết</a></b> won a Latin Grammy Award?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S%C3%B4_Y_Ti%E1%BA%BFt","retrieved":1785746865029},{"title":"Tabancale language (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that only five words are known from the extinct <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tabancale_language\" title=\"Tabancale language\">Tabancale language</a></b> of Peru and Ecuador?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tabancale_language","retrieved":1785746865030},{"title":"Chris Williams (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that when <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Williams_(bishop)\" title=\"Chris Williams (bishop)\">Chris Williams</a></b> showed Elizabeth<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>II his church's narwhal tusk, she reportedly said that she had a longer one?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Williams_(bishop)","retrieved":1785746865032},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;.